                "надо",
                "хочу"
              ],
              "answer": "надо",
              "hint": "Necessity (colloquial variant of нужно).",
              "explanation": "Надо + infinitive = need to (colloquial). Same meaning as нужно."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Они хотят _____ в парк. (to go)",
              "promptEnglish": "They want to go to the park.",
              "options": [
